Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened:
	.string "{PLAYER}把密码写在了\n"
	.string "门上。\p"
	.string "“机关大师是天才。”\n"
	.string "… … … … … … … …\p"
	.string "锁咔嗒一声开了！$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll1Intro:
	.string "咔嗒咔嗒……\n"
	.string "我乃机械人偶1号！\p"
	.string "答对测验，你就能去\n"
	.string "机械人偶5号那里。\l"
	.string "然后就能拿到密码。$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll1Quiz1:
	.string "机械人偶1号测验。\p"
	.string "这些宝可梦有一只不在\n"
	.string "110号道路上。是哪只？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll1Quiz2:
	.string "机械人偶1号测验。\p"
	.string "这些宝可梦有一只不是\n"
	.string "水属性。是哪只？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll1Quiz3:
	.string "机械人偶1号测验。\p"
	.string "这些宝可梦有一只不会\n"
	.string "吸血。是哪只？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_CorrectGoThrough:
	.string "恭喜。答对了。\n"
	.string "请通过。$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_DisappointmentError:
	.string "哔——。很失望。\n"
	.string "错误。$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Wahahahaha:
	.string "哇哈哈哈哈哈！\n"
	.string "哇哈哈哈哈哈！\l"
	.string "咔嗒咔嗒！$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_WaitForNextChallenge:
	.string "我们等着你的\n"
	.string "下一个挑战。$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll2Intro:
	.string "咔嗒咔嗒……\n"
	.string "我乃机械人偶2号！\p"
	.string "机械人偶1号的测验难度\n"
	.string "设得太低了。$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll2Quiz1:
	.string "机械人偶2号测验。\p"
	.string "这些宝可梦里，小胜从\n"
	.string "你爸爸那里借的是哪只？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll2Quiz2:
	.string "机械人偶2号测验。\p"
	.string "这些宝可梦里，哪只\n"
	.string "在追小田卷博士？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll2Quiz3:
	.string "机械人偶2号测验。\p"
	.string "这些宝可梦里，水舰队\n"
	.string "在橙华森林用了哪只？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll3Intro:
	.string "咔嗒咔嗒……\n"
	.string "我乃机械人偶3号！\p"
	.string "我只看钱的事。$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll3Quiz1:
	.string "机械人偶3号测验。\p"
	.string "哪个更贵？\n"
	.string "三张港口邮件还是一瓶\l"
	.string "灼伤药？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll3Quiz2:
	.string "机械人偶3号测验。\p"
	.string "卖掉一个超级球，买\n"
	.string "一瓶伤药。还剩多少钱？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll3Quiz3:
	.string "机械人偶3号测验。\p"
	.string "一个驱虫喷雾加一瓶\n"
	.string "汽水，比一瓶好伤药\l"
	.string "贵吗？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll4Intro:
	.string "咔嗒咔嗒……\n"
	.string "我就是机械人偶4号！\p"
	.string "我的测验是件艺术品。$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll4Quiz1:
	.string "机械人偶4号测验。\p"
	.string "海边小屋里，男人多\n"
	.string "还是女人多？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll4Quiz2:
	.string "机械人偶4号测验。\p"
	.string "釜炎镇里，老爷爷多\n"
	.string "还是老奶奶多？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll4Quiz3:
	.string "机械人偶4号测验。\p"
	.string "训练家学校里，有几个\n"
	.string "女学生？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll5Intro:
	.string "咔嗒咔嗒……\n"
	.string "我乃机械人偶5号！\p"
	.string "我是主人最棒最骄傲的\n"
	.string "作品。$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll5Quiz1:
	.string "机械人偶5号测验。\p"
	.string "凯那的宝可梦同好会里，\n"
	.string "有几只宝可梦？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll5Quiz2:
	.string "机械人偶5号测验。\p"
	.string "茵郁市里有几座\n"
	.string "树屋？$"

Route110_TrickHousePuzzle5_Text_Mechadoll5Quiz3:
	.string "机械人偶5号测验。\p"
	.string "海边自行车道上有几个\n"
	.string "铁人三项选手？$"
`
